\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.11}{\ignorespaces Marker-facing summary of the intermittent-co-location arm: SSM{}-violation reduction by method with the success cost annotated. Only critic-gated speed-scaling combines a substantial velocity-axis reduction with a small success cost; the unconditional scaler buys slightly more reduction at several times the cost, the veto and the Lagrangian buy little or none. The persistent-regime counterpart of this figure is Table~\ref {tab:e4.1-feature-incremental}.}}{62}{figure.caption.72}\protected@file@percent }
